Package: BiocAddins
Title: Bioconductor Addins for RStudio
Version: 0.99.23
Authors@R: person(
    "Marcel", "Ramos", , "marcel.ramos@sph.cuny.edu",
    c("aut", "cre"), c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3242-0582")
  )
Description: BiocAddins provides a set of RStudio Addins that make it easy
    to work with Bioconductor. These Addins are developer centric and include
    actions such as running BiocCheck, bumping package versions, and creating
    Rproj files. Experimental Addins include using the vignette as a
    README file, rendering the README from an RMarkdown file, and
    updating the NEWS file from recent commits.
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
